{'symbol': 'PANW', 'date': '2021-11-08 11:20:00', 'title': 'PALO ALTO NETWORKS POSITIONED AS A LEADER IN 2021 GARTNER® MAGIC QUADRANT™ FOR NETWORK FIREWALLS FOR THE TENTH CONSECUTIVE TIME', 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF., NOV. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PALO ALTO NETWORKS (NASDAQ: PANW), THE GLOBAL CYBERSECURITY LEADER, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY HAS BEEN POSITIONED AS A LEADER IN THE MAGIC QUADRANT® FOR NETWORK FIREWALLS REPORT BY GARTNER INC. IT WAS POSITIONED FURTHEST TO THE RIGHT FOR COMPLETENESS OF VISION AND HIGHEST FOR ABILITY TO EXECUTE AMONG THE 19 VENDORS EVALUATED.'}